# what's new
('<section id="whats-new" class="whats-new" aria-labelledby="new-h">\n  <div class="wrap">\n    <div class="new-head">\n      <div>\n        <p class="eyebrow">Recently added</p>\n        <h2 id="new-h">What\'s new</h2>\n      </div>\n      <p class="sub">Help with the words around your code, quick choices when a request is vague, and messages for work chat.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class="fold" id="new-fold">\n    <ul class="new-grid">\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#quick-options"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 6h11M9 12h11M9 18h11M4 6h1M4 12h1M4 18h1"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Quick options</b><small>Just say "help with this" and pick from 2 to 4 short choices. Clear requests go straight to the work.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#readme"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h13v16H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2zM4 21V5M8 7h7M8 11h5"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>README files and docs</b><small>A plain opening and real install steps, with every command kept exactly.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#commit-message"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12h6M15 12h6M12 9a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6z"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Commit messages and PRs</b><small>A short summary line and the reason, based only on what\'s in your diff.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#architecture"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4h6v4H4zM14 10h6v4h-6zM14 16h6v4h-6zM7 8v10h7M7 12h7"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Architecture and folder structure</b><small>How your project fits together, using the real folder names. Decision records too.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#code-comments"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 8l-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4M13 6l-2 12"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Code comments, code untouched</b><small>Clearer comments and docstrings. The script won\'t save if any code would change.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#work-chat"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h12v8H9l-5 4zM20 9v10l-3-2h-6"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Work chat messages</b><small>Slack, Teams, and Google Chat messages with the point in the first line.</small></span></a></li>\n    </ul>\n    </div>\n    <button class="fold-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="new-fold" aria-describedby="new-h" hidden><span class="fold-more">Show more</span><span class="fold-less">Show less</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button>\n    <a class="more-link" href="guide.html">See how to use each one in the guide <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>\n    <a class="more-link" href="changelog.html">See every release in the changelog <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n',
 '<section id="whats-new" class="whats-new" aria-labelledby="new-h">\n  <div class="wrap">\n    <div class="new-head">\n      <div>\n        <p class="eyebrow">हाल में जोड़ा गया</p>\n        <h2 id="new-h">क्या नया है</h2>\n      </div>\n      <p class="sub">Code के आस-पास के शब्दों में मदद, अधूरी request पर झट से चुनने वाले options, और work chat के messages।</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class="fold" id="new-fold">\n    <ul class="new-grid">\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#quick-options"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 6h11M9 12h11M9 18h11M4 6h1M4 12h1M4 18h1"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>झटपट options</b><small>बस "help with this" कहिए और 2 से 4 छोटे options में से चुनिए। साफ़ request पर सीधे काम शुरू।</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#readme"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h13v16H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2zM4 21V5M8 7h7M8 11h5"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>README और docs</b><small>सीधी शुरुआत और असली install steps, हर command बिल्कुल वैसी ही।</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#commit-message"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12h6M15 12h6M12 9a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6z"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Commit messages और PRs</b><small>छोटी summary line और वजह, सिर्फ़ उसी के आधार पर जो आपके diff में है।</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#architecture"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4h6v4H4zM14 10h6v4h-6zM14 16h6v4h-6zM7 8v10h7M7 12h7"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Architecture और folder structure</b><small>आपका project कैसे जुड़ा है, असली folder नामों के साथ। Decision records भी।</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#code-comments"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 8l-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4M13 6l-2 12"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Code comments, code वैसा ही</b><small>साफ़ comments और docstrings। Code ज़रा भी बदले तो script save नहीं करती।</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#work-chat"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h12v8H9l-5 4zM20 9v10l-3-2h-6"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Work chat messages</b><small>Slack, Teams और Google Chat के messages, असली बात पहली line में।</small></span></a></li>\n    </ul>\n    </div>\n    <button class="fold-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="new-fold" aria-describedby="new-h" hidden><span class="fold-more">Show more</span><span class="fold-less">Show less</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button>\n    <a class="more-link" href="guide.html">हर एक कैसे इस्तेमाल करें, guide में देखिए <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>\n    <a class="more-link" href="../changelog.html" hreflang="en">हर release की पूरी जानकारी changelog में देखिए (अंग्रेज़ी में) <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n',
 '<section id="whats-new" class="whats-new" aria-labelledby="new-h">\n  <div class="wrap">\n    <div class="new-head">\n      <div>\n        <p class="eyebrow">சமீபத்தில் சேர்த்தவை</p>\n        <h2 id="new-h">என்ன புதுசு</h2>\n      </div>\n      <p class="sub">Code-ஐ சுத்தி இருக்கும் வார்த்தைகளுக்கு உதவி, கேள்வி தெளிவா இல்லாதப்போ சின்ன options, work chat messages.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class="fold" id="new-fold">\n    <ul class="new-grid">\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#quick-options"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 6h11M9 12h11M9 18h11M4 6h1M4 12h1M4 18h1"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>சட்டுனு options</b><small>"help with this"னு மட்டும் சொல்லுங்க, 2 முதல் 4 சின்ன options-ல ஒன்னை தேர்ந்தெடுங்க. தெளிவான கேள்விக்கு நேரா வேலை.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#readme"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h13v16H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2zM4 21V5M8 7h7M8 11h5"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>README, docs</b><small>எளிய ஆரம்பம், உண்மையான install steps, ஒவ்வொரு command-உம் அப்படியே.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#commit-message"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12h6M15 12h6M12 9a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6z"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Commit messages, PRs</b><small>சின்ன summary line, காரணம், உங்க diff-ல இருக்கறதை மட்டும் வச்சு.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#architecture"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4h6v4H4zM14 10h6v4h-6zM14 16h6v4h-6zM7 8v10h7M7 12h7"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Architecture, folder structure</b><small>உங்க project எப்படி இணைஞ்சிருக்குன்னு, உண்மையான folder பெயர்களோட. Decision records-உம்.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#code-comments"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 8l-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4M13 6l-2 12"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Code comments, code அப்படியே</b><small>தெளிவான comments, docstrings. Code கொஞ்சம் மாறினாலும் script save பண்ணாது.</small></span></a></li>\n      <li><a class="new-card" href="guide.html#work-chat"><span class="new-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h12v8H9l-5 4zM20 9v10l-3-2h-6"/></svg></span><span class="new-tx"><b>Work chat messages</b><small>Slack, Teams, Google Chat messages, முக்கிய விஷயம் முதல் வரியிலேயே.</small></span></a></li>\n    </ul>\n    </div>\n    <button class="fold-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="new-fold" aria-describedby="new-h" hidden><span class="fold-more">Show more</span><span class="fold-less">Show less</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button>\n    <a class="more-link" href="guide.html">ஒவ்வொன்னையும் எப்படி பயன்படுத்தறதுன்னு guide-ல பாருங்க <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>\n    <a class="more-link" href="../changelog.html" hreflang="en">ஒவ்வொரு release பத்தியும் changelog-ல பாருங்க (ஆங்கிலத்தில்) <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n',False),
